  "job_B14.25_20251003_114307": {
    "text": "\u00d0is man ger\u00e6dde, \u00f0a se micele here com to lande.\nEalle we be\u00feurfan, \u00fe\u00e6t we geornlice earnian, \u00fe\u00e6t we Godes miltse & his mildheortnesse habban moton\nNu wille we, \u00fe\u00e6t eal folc to gem\u00e6nelicre d\u00e6dbote \u00ferig dagas be hlafe & wirtum & w\u00e6tere, \u00fe\u00e6t is on\n& cume manna gehwilc b\u00e6refot to circan buton golde & gl\u00e6ncgum, & ga man to scrifte.\n& gan ealle ut mid halidome & clipian inweardre heortan georne to Criste.\n& sceote man \u00e6ghwilce hide p\u00e6nig o\u00f0\u00f0e p\u00e6niges weor\u00f0.\n& bringe man \u00fe\u00e6t to cirican & si\u00f0\u00f0an on \u00fereo d\u00e6le be scriftes & be tunesgerefan gewitnesse.\n& gif hwa \u00feis ne gel\u00e6ste, \u00f0onne gebete he \u00fe\u00e6t, swa swa hit gelagod is: bunda mid XXX p\u00e6nigum \u00fer\u00e6l\n& swa hwar swa \u00fe\u00e6t feoh up arise, d\u00e6le man on Godes est \u00e6ghwilcne p\u00e6nig.\n& ealswa \u00feone mete, \u00fee gehwa brucan wolde, gif him \u00fe\u00e6t f\u00e6sten swa geboden n\u00e6re, d\u00e6le man on\n& hiredmanna gehwilc sille p\u00e6nig to \u00e6lmessan, o\u00f0\u00f0e his hlaford sille for hine, buton he silf h\u00e6bbe; &\n& \u00feeowemen \u00fea \u00f0rig dagas beon weorces gefreode wi\u00f0 ciricsocne & wi\u00f0 \u00f0am, \u00fee hi \u00fe\u00e6t f\u00e6sten \u00fee\n& on \u00e6ghwilcan mynstre singe eal geferr\u00e6den \u00e6tg\u00e6dere heora saltere \u00fea \u00f0ry dagas.\n& \u00e6lc m\u00e6ssepreost m\u00e6ssige for urne hlaford & for ealle his \u00feeode.\n& \u00fear to eacan m\u00e6ssige man \u00e6ghwilce d\u00e6ge on \u00e6lcan minstre ane m\u00e6ssan sinderlice for \u00f0are neode,\n& \u00e6t \u00e6lcan tidsange eal hired a\u00feenedum limum \u00e6tforan Godes weofode singe \u00feone sealm: Domine,\n& ealle gem\u00e6nelice, gehadode & l\u00e6wede, bugan to Gode georne & geearnian his mildse.\n& \u00e6ghwilce geare heonon for\u00f0 gel\u00e6ste man Godes gerihta huru rihtlice, wi\u00f0 \u00f0am \u00fee us God \u00e6lmihtig\nGod ure helpe. Amen.",
